    "intro_html":  "Ethiopia\u0027s national dish: chicken thighs braised in a deep red berbere and slow-cooked onion sauce, finished with hard boiled eggs. Each bowl brings a serious \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e at just {{cal}} calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). The onions cook down into the sauce itself, so there is no flour, no cream, and no filler.",
    "ingredients_display": ["\u003cstrong\u003eBoneless Skinless Chicken Thigh (Member\u0027s Mark):\u003c/strong\u003e 7 lb (3175 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eLemon Juice (ReaLemon):\u003c/strong\u003e 3.5 lemons worth (164 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eRed Onion:\u003c/strong\u003e 7 onions (770 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eVegetable Oil (Great Value):\u003c/strong\u003e 0.75 cups (147 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eGarlic:\u003c/strong\u003e 12.25 tbsp (105 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eGinger (generic):\u003c/strong\u003e 3.5 tbsp (21 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eBerbere Seasoning (Frontier Co-op):\u003c/strong\u003e 8.75 tbsp (60 g)","\u003cstrong\u003ePaprika:\u003c/strong\u003e 3.5 tbsp (24 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eTomato Paste (Great Value):\u003c/strong\u003e 7 tbsp (112 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eChicken Broth (Swanson):\u003c/strong\u003e 2.75 lb (1260 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eButter (generic):\u003c/strong\u003e 7 tbsp (98 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eEggs (Great Value):\u003c/strong\u003e 18 large eggs (875 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eSalt (Morton):\u003c/strong\u003e 1 tbsp (20 g)","\u003cstrong\u003eBlack Pepper (Great Value):\u003c/strong\u003e 0.5 tbsp (4 g)"],
